  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- New analyzer rule FFS0055 prohibits UnconditionalSuppressMessageAttribute, except suppressions for trimming and AOT (#517)\n### Fixed\n- FFS0014/FFS0015 no longer report JsonSerializer overloads taking JsonTypeInfo or JsonSerializerContext (#501)\n- FFS0021/FFS0034 analyzers now map arguments to parameters by name and position (reordered, multi-line and static forms) and compare by constant value, fixing false negatives\n- FFS0039/FFS0040 now detect types declared inside file-scoped namespaces, ignoring file-local types, so these types are no longer missed (#506)\n- FFS0023/FFS0024/FFS0025 now analyse primary constructors on classes, skip generic classes, and treat internal sealed classes as leaf classes, so a plain ILogger injected there is now reported by FFS0024; abstract and nested status is taken from the class symbol so partial classes are handled correctly (#507)\n- FFS0008 now reports bare #pragma warning disable and accepts CS-prefixed allowed codes; restore directives get their own message; added FFS0008/FFS0022 test coverage (#508)\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.322\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3",
